usage: __main__.py [-h]
                   {prepare,prepare-fresh-validation,prepare-learning-study,prepare-action-study,prepare-scientific,prepare-validation,index,index-bounded,verify,score,run,_serve}
                   ...

Reader recovery v1: bounded diagnosis, no automatic selection/confirmation

positional arguments:
  {prepare,prepare-fresh-validation,prepare-learning-study,prepare-action-study,prepare-scientific,prepare-validation,index,index-bounded,verify,score,run,_serve}
    prepare             reserve fresh IDs and project diagnostic evidence
                        before outcomes
    prepare-fresh-validation
                        NEW v2: independent metadata preparation only;
                        scientific execution disabled
    prepare-learning-study
                        NEW v5: frozen fit and untouched learning-holdout
                        acquisition
    prepare-action-study
                        NEW v4: admitted-reader independent 2/5/10 development
                        action screen
    prepare-scientific  NEW v3: single-use frozen native reader trial through
                        actual allocation runner
    prepare-validation  freeze the single authored candidate on the prior
                        untouched64 IDs; no resampling
    run                 native diagnostic group; single attempt, no semantic
                        retry
    _serve              native diagnostic group; single attempt, no semantic
                        retry

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
